<speak>Having an easy alternative can make the plan feel less fragile. And leaving some afternoons genuinely free is valuable too. Coming back to your home paperwork, would you like to talk about the portal now? We can keep it general, since you said you'd rather not open it during the call. Tell me what you remember seeing when you couldn't find the help page. A menu title or a description of the layout is sufficient; there is no need to recite anything from your documents.</speak>